msgid "AnduinOS disables all system-level telemetry by default."
msgstr "AnduinOS menonaktifkan semua telemetri tingkat sistem secara default."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2129
msgid "We do not collect your usage habits."
msgstr "Kami tidak mengumpulkan kebiasaan penggunaan Anda."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2130
msgid "We do not upload your search history."
msgstr "Kami tidak mengunggah riwayat pencarian Anda."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2130
msgid "There are no pervasive advertisements."
msgstr "Tidak ada iklan yang pervasif."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2141
msgid ""
"In an era ruled by algorithms and surveillance, this is our firmest "
"commitment to you."
msgstr ""
"Di era yang dikuasai oleh algoritma dan pengawasan, inilah komitmen terkuat "
"kami kepada Anda."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2159
msgid "✓ Zero telemetry — your activity is yours alone"
msgstr "✓ Nol telemetri — aktivitas Anda hanya milik Anda sendiri"

